1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,240
(Amy:)What is it?

2
00:00:01,571 --> 00:00:02,981
(Sheldon:)A quarter.

3
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:09,180
(Amy:)Could have given it back to me.
That was a choice.

4
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,620
(Raj:)You look really pretty tonight.

5
00:00:19,789 --> 00:00:21,999
(Emily:)Thanks. I love that jacket.

6
00:00:22,158 --> 00:00:23,698
(Raj:)Thank you. Thanks.

7
00:00:26,963 --> 00:00:28,463
(Raj:)I'm sorry. I can't do this.

8
00:00:28,631 --> 00:00:31,701
(Raj:)My ex-girlfriend emailed me,
and I'm seeing her Saturday.

9
00:00:31,868 --> 00:00:34,278
(Raj:)And I'm glad you like it,
it's from J. Crew.

10
00:00:36,606 --> 00:00:37,846
(Emily:)I don't understand.

11
00:00:38,007 --> 00:00:40,507
(Raj:)My friends told me it was okay to see
more than one person at a time,

12
00:00:40,677 --> 00:00:43,287
but it feels like
I'm being deceitful.

13
00:00:43,446 --> 00:00:44,986
(Emily:)Are you getting
back together with her?

14
00:00:46,049 --> 00:00:49,499
No. I have no idea.
What would you do?

15
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:53,660
(Emily:)Usually on first dates,
I talk about music and stuff,

16
00:00:53,823 --> 00:00:57,023
(Emily:)but I was promised weird,
so let's do this.

